{genre: Gospel}
{flow: Meditative}
{style: Spiritual}
{key: C}
{key_original: D}
{tempo: 84}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Kum [C]ba yah, my [F]Lord, kum ba [C]yah
Kum [C]ba yah, my [F]Lord, kum ba [G7]yah
Kum [C]ba yah, my [F]Lord, kum ba [C]yah
Oh [F]Lord, kum ba [G7]yah[C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Someone's [C]singing, Lord, [F]kum ba [C]yah
Someone's [C]singing, Lord, [F]kum ba [G7]yah
Someone's [C]singing, Lord, [F]kum ba [C]yah
Oh [F]Lord, kum ba [G7]yah[C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Someone's [C]praying, Lord, [F]kum ba [C]yah
Someone's [C]praying, Lord, [F]kum ba [G7]yah
Someone's [C]praying, Lord, [F]kum ba [C]yah
Oh [F]Lord, kum ba [G7]yah[C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
Someone's [C]crying, Lord, [F]kum ba [C]yah
Someone's [C]crying, Lord, [F]kum ba [G7]yah
